      "id": "claim_547d1d9bf01842d993faccd146699204",
      "statement": "`ng serve` uses `src/environments/environment.dev.ts` through the development build configuration's file replacement of `src/environments/environment.ts`, while production builds read `environment.ts`; both files carry `apiUrl` and the `features` flags.",
