      "id": "claim_1eef185e9d3c4b12ad085366aa8207c5",
      "statement": "`ulabase setup` writes the service URL into the `apiUrl` line of `environment.dev.ts` as its last step (`appPointsAtService`), and an empty or invalid `apiUrl` causes `app.config.ts` to register an empty route table so the app renders the connect-your-service screen instead of running route guards against a missing backend.",
