    {
      "id": "claim_2e3203c82a4c4f88a1a820ff01f49199",
      "statement": "After bumping `TOS_VERSION` / `PP_VERSION` in `ulabase.setup.consents.ts`, re-run `ulabase setup --srv <srvId> --file ulabase.setup.consents.ts` so the guards rule and the permission's `mergeRequest` move together; otherwise a user is blocked by a form that appeared to work. The `Version 2026-07-01` line in `public/terms.html` and `public/privacy.html` is a third place kept in step by hand.",
