    {
      "id": "claim_9151e5e13b794323bc89d837d525ec53",
      "statement": "`checkSession()` and `login()` must load teams as a side effect: `checkSession()` short-circuits to null with empty teams when no token is stored and otherwise fetches the user then the teams, and the home page relies on `authGuard`'s `checkSession()` having populated memberships. Skipping these side effects leaves team-dependent UI intermittently empty.",
